;; sarutahiko-factory-r0 — 建材 + 設備 台帳 (building-materials + equipment ledger),
;; Datomic-style EDN. SSoT for every physical element of the 猿田彦 Class-8 truck
;; assembly plant simulated by `kami-app-sarutahiko-factory` (ADR-2606013100).
;;
;; Same shape as the giemon-factory `building.edn` (ADR-2606010030) so the shared
;; `kotoba_gen.py` reader/SBOM/IFC toolchain is reused unchanged: each part becomes
;; one kotoba entity whose claims are kg/claim/part/* datoms (EAVT, ADR-2605312345);
;; the whole file also emits a CycloneDX SBOM.
;;
;; The building shell + MEP + 外構 + raw-materials groups (A-E, G-L) are the same
;; generic industrial fit-out as the giemon plant (a steel portal-frame bay scales
;; from a light-assembly plant to a truck plant by size, not by kind). The CHANGE
;; vs the giemon plant is group F (production equipment): truck-line machines —
;; frame jigs / stamping press / BIW weld jigs / paint booth / GA marriage gantry /
;; EOL roller dyno — PLUS the line robots, including F10 積込ロボット (the loading
;; robot that loads a finished truck onto a carrier, simulated by the `*_load`
;; entry of the kami-app crate).
;;
;; :part/group        A-foundation · B-steel-frame · C-roof · D-cladding ·
;;                    E-mep · F-equipment · G-electrical · H-water · I-gas ·
;;                    J-fire-safety · K-site (外構/外部動線) · L-raw-materials (原材料)
;; :part/procurement  :cots — buy off-the-shelf (has :part/manufacturer + :part/purl)
;;                    :custom-fab — cast / weld / commission on site
;; :part/sim-feature  links the part to a render element id in factory.scene.json
;; :part/sourcing     :representative — R0 design selection, NOT a procurement-verified
;;                    purchase or building-permit decision. Confirm before buying/building.

{:bom/meta
 {:bom/of          "sarutahiko-factory-r0"
  :bom/revision    "v1"
  :bom/title       "猿田彦 Class-8 truck assembly plant — R0 building + equipment BOM"
  :bom/currency    "JPY"
  :bom/sourcing    :representative
  :bom/note        "R0 design BOM for a 180m x 90m steel portal-frame truck assembly plant (full MEP + 外構 + 出荷ヤード) producing the Class-8 cargo truck of ADR-2605252500. Building shell (A-E) + utilities (G electrical / H water / I gas / J fire) routed as kami-genesis geometry; site/外部動線 + 出荷ヤード (K) outside the bay; raw materials (L) as bulk inputs; production equipment (F) = truck-line machines + line robots incl. F10 積込ロボット. Manufacturer/MPN/数量/length-m/area-m2/mass are representative R0 design figures, NOT a finalized purchase, 確認申請, 消防同意, or 受電/受水/ガス供給契約. Capital-intensive heavy-truck plant per ADR-2605252500 §Consequences — R3 community-scale is Council + LANDS.md gated."}

